{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":50,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["真實的敬拜"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["亞薩的詩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"大能者上帝－耶和華已經發言招呼天下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從日出之地到日落之處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從全美的錫安中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝已經發光了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"我們的上帝要來，決不閉口。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有烈火在他面前吞滅；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有暴風在他四圍大颳。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他招呼上天下地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為要審判他的民，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說：招聚我的聖民到我這裏來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是那些用祭物與我立約的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"諸天必表明他的公義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為上帝是施行審判的。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"我的民哪，你們當聽我的話！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，我要勸戒你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是上帝，是你的上帝！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我並不因你的祭物責備你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的燔祭常在我面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不從你家中取公牛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不從你圈內取山羊；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為，樹林中的百獸是我的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"千山上的牲畜也是我的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山中的飛鳥，我都知道；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野地的走獸也都屬我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"我若是飢餓，我不用告訴你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為世界和其中所充滿的都是我的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈吃公牛的肉呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈喝山羊的血呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要以感謝為祭獻與上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又要向至高者還你的願，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並要在患難之日求告我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必搭救你，你也要榮耀我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"但上帝對惡人說：你怎敢傳說我的律例，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"口中提到我的約呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其實你恨惡管教，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將我的言語丟在背後。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你見了盜賊就樂意與他同夥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又與行姦淫的人一同有分。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"你口任說惡言；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你舌編造詭詐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你坐着毀謗你的兄弟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讒毀你親母的兒子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你行了這些事，我還閉口不言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你想我恰和你一樣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其實我要責備你，將這些事擺在你眼前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"你們忘記上帝的，要思想這事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得我把你們撕碎，無人搭救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡以感謝獻上為祭的便是榮耀我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那按正路而行的，我必使他得着我的救恩。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/50.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/51.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/49.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}